{"page": 106, "lines": [{"t": "DSP-2232 OPERATING MANUAL", "x": 265.0, "y": 129.0}, {"t": "BAUDOT AND ASCII OPERATION", "x": 1352.0, "y": 132.0}, {"t": "6.7", "x": 266.0, "y": 206.0}, {"t": "6.7. 1", "x": 257.0, "y": 1207.0}, {"t": "7/92", "x": 248.0, "y": 2542.0}, {"t": "Simultaneous RTTY and Packet Operation", "x": 469.0, "y": 209.0}, {"t": "Your DSP—2232 can operate on Baudot or ASCII RTTY on Radio Port 1 and", "x": 469.0, "y": 289.0}, {"t": "HF or VHF Packet on Radio Port 2 at the same time. With this feature", "x": 468.0, "y": 329.0}, {"t": "you won't miss any local Packet activity while operating RTTY .", "x": 467.0, "y": 369.0}, {"t": "Before the second radio port can be used for packet operation, a", "x": 468.0, "y": 449.0}, {"t": "modem must be loaded that can access the second port. There are two", "x": 465.0, "y": 489.0}, {"t": "types of RTTY modems available. The f irst type is a single port", "x": 466.0, "y": 529.0}, {"t": "modem which disables packet operation on", "x": 464.0, "y": 568.0}, {"t": "listed below.", "x": 467.0, "y": 607.0}, {"t": "MODEM", "x": 566.0, "y": 690.0}, {"t": "MODEM", "x": 565.0, "y": 729.0}, {"t": "MODEM", "x": 565.0, "y": 769.0}, {"t": "MODEM", "x": 565.0, "y": 810.0}, {"t": "The second", "x": 462.0, "y": 888.0}, {"t": "1", "x": 712.0, "y": 690.0}, {"t": "2", "x": 710.0, "y": 729.0}, {"t": "3", "x": 710.0, "y": 769.0}, {"t": "4", "x": 709.0, "y": 809.0}, {"t": "AFSK Modem,", "x": 768.0, "y": 690.0}, {"t": "AFSK Modem,", "x": 769.0, "y": 729.0}, {"t": "AFSK Modem,", "x": 768.0, "y": 769.0}, {"t": "AFSK Modem,", "x": 768.0, "y": 809.0}, {"t": "170 Hz shift,", "x": 1014.0, "y": 690.0}, {"t": "170 Hz shift,", "x": 1014.0, "y": 729.0}, {"t": "425 Hz shift,", "x": 1012.0, "y": 769.0}, {"t": "850 Hz shift,", "x": 1012.0, "y": 809.0}, {"t": "radio port 2.", "x": 1293.0, "y": 569.0}, {"t": "Mark=2125 Hz,", "x": 1291.0, "y": 689.0}, {"t": "Mark=1445 Hz,", "x": 1292.0, "y": 729.0}, {"t": "Mark=2125 Hz,", "x": 1292.0, "y": 769.0}, {"t": "Mark=2125 Hz,", "x": 1292.0, "y": 809.0}, {"t": "These are", "x": 1599.0, "y": 569.0}, {"t": "Space-2295 Hz", "x": 1580.0, "y": 688.0}, {"t": "Space-1275 Hz", "x": 1579.0, "y": 728.0}, {"t": "Space=2550 Hz", "x": 1579.0, "y": 767.0}, {"t": "Space=297S Hz", "x": 1580.0, "y": 808.0}, {"t": "type of modem is \"Dual Ported\", that is allows for RTTY", "x": 688.0, "y": 889.0}, {"t": "operation on radio port I and packet operation on radio port 2 at the", "x": 461.0, "y": 928.0}, {"t": "same time .", "x": 463.0, "y": 969.0}, {"t": "The dual port RTTY modems available in the DSP—2232 are", "x": 707.0, "y": 969.0}, {"t": "listed below.", "x": 463.0, "y": 1008.0}, {"t": "MODEM 30: RTTY/TOR 170 Hz:", "x": 563.0, "y": 1090.0}, {"t": "MODEM 31: RTTY/TOR 170 Hz:", "x": 562.0, "y": 1130.0}, {"t": "Select inq and Load ina Modems", "x": 460.0, "y": 1209.0}, {"t": "2125/2295; p2 Packet 300 bps HF", "x": 1134.0, "y": 1090.0}, {"t": "2125/2295; p2 Packet 1200 bps VHF", "x": 1133.0, "y": 1130.0}, {"t": "The various modems available in the DSP—2232 can be seen with the", "x": 459.0, "y": 1290.0}, {"t": "DIRECT (or y) cornrnand. To display all the available modems simply", "x": 458.0, "y": 1330.0}, {"t": "enter the Command Mode of the DSP—2232 and then type DIR as shown.", "x": 458.0, "y": 1370.0}, {"t": "DIR", "x": 642.0, "y": 1453.0}, {"t": "The DSP—2232 will respond with the following:", "x": 457.0, "y": 1531.0}, {"t": "(920716)", "x": 462.0, "y": 1612.0}, {"t": "1:", "x": 479.0, "y": 1653.0}, {"t": "3:", "x": 477.0, "y": 1694.0}, {"t": "10:", "x": 457.0, "y": 1734.0}, {"t": "12:", "x": 457.0, "y": 1774.0}, {"t": "14:", "x": 457.0, "y": 1815.0}, {"t": "16:", "x": 456.0, "y": 1854.0}, {"t": "18:", "x": 456.0, "y": 1895.0}, {"t": "22:", "x": 455.0, "y": 1936.0}, {"t": "25:", "x": 455.0, "y": 1976.0}, {"t": "30:", "x": 455.0, "y": 2017.0}, {"t": "31:", "x": 454.0, "y": 2058.0}, {"t": "33:", "x": 454.0, "y": 2099.0}, {"t": "35:", "x": 454.0, "y": 2139.0}, {"t": "40:", "x": 454.0, "y": 2180